<title>USA: CalEnergy says NYSEG has no poison pill.</title>
<headline>CalEnergy says NYSEG has no poison pill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>CalEnergy Co Inc chief executive officer David Sokol said target New York State Electric &amp; Gas Corp does not have a poison pill in place to prohibit a transaction.</p>
<p>He made his comments during a conference call with reporters to discuss the company's proposed takeover of the New York utility.</p>
<p>((-- Robin Sidel, 212 859-1723))</p>
</text>
